{"id":"dorf","lemma":"Dorf","pos":"noun","rank":1007,"glosses":["village (rural habitation of size between a hamlet and a town)","backwater (remote place; somewhere that remains unaffected by new events, progresses, ideas, etc.)"],"ipa":"/dɔrf/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a2/De-Dorf2.ogg/De-Dorf2.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Dorfes","plural":"Dörfer"},"formAudio":{"Dorfes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Dorfes.wav","Dörfer":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-D%C3%B6rfer.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich hasse dieses Dorf.","en":"I hate this village.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate","l":"hassen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]},{"text":"Sie lebt in dem Dorf.","en":"She lives in the village.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"a state in which…","l":"Leben"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Wir wohnen am anderen Ende des Dorfes.","en":"We live at the other end of the village.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to live, reside, dwell"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"another , others","l":"anderer"},{"g":"end, finish"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Das Dorf braucht deine Hilfe.","en":"The village needs your help.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"the act of helping"}]},{"text":"Unsere Schule ist in diesem Dorf.","en":"Our school is in this village.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]}]}